  "result": "I fixed the clamping bug in `IntRange._clamp` in `src/click/types.py`; I did not run the tests.\n\nWhen a range boundary is open (`min_open` or `max_open`), the clamp has to move one step inward from the bound. The code moved the wrong way: it computed `bound - dir`, so clamping below an open `min` returned `min - 1` instead of `min + 1`. That value was outside the allowed range. It now returns `bound + dir`.",
